== Effect ==
* {{dlc|nr}} {{tear delay down|2|no bullet=yes}}
* {{dlc|r}} +1.0 [[fire rate]].

== Notes ==
* Cancer's tear delay reduction scales with the current tear modifier's fire rate multiplier, the only exception being {{i|Chocolate Milk}}.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket}} / {{i|Mom's Box}}: Having either increases [[fire rate]] by 2.0. Having both by 3.0.

